{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 17, :comments ["<b>You declared YHWH today</b> — gematria: this is the reading of Shema." "<b>You declared YHWH</b> — here a hint to the six Orders. להיות לך לאלהים — this is the Order of Zera'im, which begins with the Shema. And further, it contains terumot and ma'aserot, which are fear of HaShem — matters between us and HaShem. וללכת בדרכיו — this is the Order of Mo'ed, as written: אם תשיב משבת רגלך. ולשמור חקיו — this is the Order of Nashim, which deals with forbidden relations, of which it is written: ושמרתם את חקותי. ומצותיו — this is the Order of Kodashim, which deals with sacrifices, of which it is written: אלה המצות. ומשפטיו — this is the Order of Nezikin. ולשמוע בקולו — this is the Order of Tohorot, as written in it: אמרות ה' אמרות טהורות. And corresponding to them He said six things: להיות לו לעם סגולה, ולתתך עליון, לתהלה, ולשם, ולתפארת, ולהיותך עם קדוש."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:10:48.530162909Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}